CI/CD Pipeline with Jenkins + Docker

1. Set up Jenkins locally (use Docker)
    * Use Dockerfile inside setup to build and run the Jenkins
    * Use the below commands to build and run the Jenkins
        1. docker build -t jenkins .
        2. docker run -d \
            --name jenkins-blueocean \
            --network jenkins \
            --publish 8080:8080 --publish 50000:50000 \
            --volume /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock \
            --volume jenkins-data:/var/jenkins_home \
            --user root \
            mac-jenkins bash -c "groupadd -for -g 1 docker && usermod -aG docker jenkins && su jenkins -c '/usr/local/bin/jenkins.sh'"
    